 elax and connect with other humans who are seeking touch based connection.
 \nWe strive for this to be a safe event. Safe touch enhances our ability t
 o connect with and trust people. When we are in a space of safety\, we are
  able to relax\, feel comfort\, and be vulnerable.\n\n**Our Agreements:**\
 n1- We ask for what we want an wait for a yes before touching others.\n2- 
 We say no if we don’t want to do something.\n3- We try to receive a no w
 ith grace and not take it personally.\n4- We arrive on time\, clean (as sc
 ent free as possible)\, and sober.\n5- We keep our pants/shorts on at this
