  here!\n\n**Who should attend:**\nPeople who are interested in safely expl
 oring touch and sensuality with strangers. This includes people who are si
 ngle\, people who are not single\, couples\, folks who are new to town and
  looking for connection\, people of all/any genders and sexual orientation
 s\, people of all ages (18 and up). People who understand and respect cons
 ent\, who will take care of themselves and people around them. This event 
