 ut our website for more information about this decision.](http://holdmeavl
 .com/why-i-dont-gender-balance-events/)\n\n**Simple definitions/clarificat
 ions-** Platonic- marked by the absence of romance or sex.\nMost of the in
 teractions we have with friends and strangers are platonic.\nSensual- grat
 ification of the senses or the indulgence of appetite.\nWe might feel sens
 ual when we feel someone's breath on our neck or experience a extra long a
 nd slow caress.\nSexual- having or involving sex.\nOften involving one mor
 e more peoples genitals\; perhaps seeking orgasm.\n\\*Refund Policy- Full 
 refund if you cancel 7 days before the event or you cancel due to illness\
 , emergency\, or direct exposure to covid. Credit towards a future event i
 f you cancel more than 3 days before an event. No refund if you cancel wit
 hin 2 days of the event or no-show.
